    explanation: "Configured as a lightweight German sport coupe (BMW CSL Homage)
      with aggressive RWD dynamics. 1250kg mass for responsiveness. 550Nm turbocharged
      engine with high RPM limit (8500) and snappy throttle response (low engineInertia
      0.06). Limited-slip differential (65%) and high final drive ratio (3.9) for
      quick acceleration. Sport suspension tuned for precision (0.14m distance, 47500N
      spring). Excellent steering response with fast steerSpeed (4.5) and negative
      camber (-2\xB0) for corner grip. Grip multiplier 1.15 for sticky tires. Stability
      aids present but moderate strengths (0.25-0.35) allowing driver involvement
      while preventing crashes. High downforce (120) for aerodynamic grip at speed.
      Optimized for spirited driving, tight handling, and German engineering feel."
