      }\n  },\n  \"suspension\": {\n    \"distance\": 0.14,\n    \"spring\": 47500,\n   
      \"damper\": 4275\n  },\n  \"wheelFriction\": {\n    \"type\": \"Balanced\"\n 
      },\n  \"wheels\": {\n    \"wheelWidth\": 0.28,\n    \"grip\": 1.15,\n    \"camber\":
      -2,\n    \"caster\": 6\n  },\n  \"stability\": {\n    \"ABS\": true,\n    \"ESP\":
      true,\n    \"TCS\": true,\n    \"steeringHelper\": true,\n    \"tractionHelper\":
      true,\n    \"angularDragHelper\": true,\n    \"steerHelperStrength\": 0.35,\n   
      \"tractionHelperStrength\": 0.3,\n    \"angularDragHelperStrength\": 0.25\n 
      },\n  \"aeroDynamics\": {\n    \"downForce\": 120,\n    \"airResistance\":
      12,\n    \"wheelResistance\": 8\n  },\n  \"nos\": {\n    \"enabled\": false\n 
      },\n  \"fuelTank\": {\n    \"enabled\": false\n  },\n  \"limiter\": {\n   
      \"enabled\": false\n  },\n  \"input\": {\n    \"counterSteering\": true,\n   
      \"counterSteerFactor\": 0.55,\n    \"steeringLimiter\": true,\n    \"autoReverse\":
      true,\n    \"steeringDeadzone\": 0.04\n  },\n  \"explanation\": \"Configured
      as a lightweight German sport coupe (BMW CSL Homage) with aggressive RWD dynamics.
      1250kg mass for responsiveness. 550Nm turbocharged engine with high RPM limit
      (8500) and snappy throttle response (low engineInertia 0.06). Limited-slip
      differential (65%) and high final drive ratio (3.9) for quick acceleration.
      Sport suspension tuned for precision (0.14m distance, 47500N spring). Excellent
      steering response with fast steerSpeed (4.5) and negative camber (-2\xB0) for
      corner grip. Grip multiplier 1.15 for sticky tires. Stability aids present
      but moderate strengths (0.25-0.35) allowing driver involvement while preventing
      crashes. High downforce (120) for aerodynamic grip at speed. Optimized for
      spirited driving, tight handling, and German engineering feel.\"\n}"
    beforeState: (New vehicle)
    beforeStateJson: 
    afterState: "Mass: 1250kg\nEngine: 550Nm, 1000-8500RPM, 240km/h\n  Turbo: 15psi\nClutch:
      engageRPM=2000, inertia=0.06, auto=True\nGearbox: Automatic, 6 gears, shift=0.12s\n 
      Ratios: [3.8, 2.4, 1.7, 1.25, 1, 0.82]\n  ShiftRPM: up=8200, down=2500\nDiff
      (RCCP_Axle_Rear): Limited, slip=65, final=3.9\nAxle (RCCP_Axle_Front): steer=True,
      power=False, brake=True\n  steerAngle=39, brakeTorque=4500, antiroll=650\nAxle
      (RCCP_Axle_Rear): steer=False, power=False, brake=True\n  steerAngle=40, brakeTorque=4000,
      antiroll=700\nStability: ABS=True, ESP=True, TCS=True\n  steerHelper=True (0.35),
      tractionHelper=True (0.3)\nSuspension: dist=0.14m, spring=47500, damper=4275\nWheels
      (Front): camber=0.0\xB0, caster=0.0\xB0, grip=1.00, width=0.250m\nWheels (Rear):
      camber=0.0\xB0, caster=0.0\xB0, grip=1.00, width=0.250m\nAero: downForce=10\nInput:
      counterSteerFactor=0.5, counterSteering=True, steeringLimiter=True\nAudio Layer
      0: RPM=0-4000, pitch=0.85-1.45, vol=0.60, dist=10-120\nAudio Layer 1: RPM=2000-7000,
      pitch=0.85-1.75, vol=0.65, dist=10-120\nAudio Layer 2: RPM=5000-8000, pitch=0.90-1.30,
      vol=0.70, dist=10-120\nAudio Layer 3: RPM=0-1200, pitch=0.55-1.55, vol=0.60,
      dist=10-120\n"
